NOTICE
======

`agent.py` is a derived work based on the remote-execution agent from the
"pi" coding-agent project — specifically the `agent.py` HTTP daemon originally
shipped alongside pi's `http-remote` extension. It has been extracted, renamed,
and neutralized of pi-specific references, but the wire protocol and much of
the server implementation retain their original design. Its provenance is also
noted in the agent.py module docstring.

This project is an independent, unaffiliated re-packaging. It is not endorsed
by, or part of, the pi project. See the LICENSE file for the terms under which
both the original and this derived work are distributed.
